WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.897
I learned the hard way

00:00:01.897 --> 00:00:03.069
the value of sleep.

00:00:03.522 --> 00:00:05.279
Two-and-a-half years ago,

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:06.857
I fainted from exhaustion. 

00:00:06.857 --> 00:00:08.837
I hit my head on my desk.

00:00:08.837 --> 00:00:10.307
I broke my cheekbone, 

00:00:10.307 --> 00:00:12.866
I got five stitches 
on my right eye.

00:00:12.866 --> 00:00:14.414
And I began the journey

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:17.428
of rediscovering  
the value of sleep.

00:00:18.821 --> 00:00:20.919
And in the course of that,

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:24.360
I studied, I met with
medical doctors, scientists.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:26.324
And I'm here to tell you

00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:28.639
that the way to a more productive,

00:00:28.639 --> 00:00:30.385
more inspired,

00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:31.796
more joyful life

00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:34.034
is getting enough sleep.

